                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1]I had a lead, a loaded gun, and three dollars. Two of those were useful.[/h1]\r\n\r\nI love noir mostly for the ol Tommy Gun and Fedora wearing gangsters of the 1920s and 30s.\r\n\r\nRot Gut is a very short side scrolling noir metroidvania with a nice retro art style and classy music. It's really short and takes under an hour to complete.\r\n\r\nIt's not the greatest metroidvania game but it is fun for the price but I wish it were longer.\r\n\r\n[h2]7/10[/h2]\r\n\r\n[h2][url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45905648-Gork%2527s-Game-Grind/]Check out my curated list of games[/url][/h2]",
